        "original_id": "8ea3d8d0-d312-51a2-a6e6-3fe43f19a58b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Nasty Girl\" (The Notorious B.I.G. song)\n- People: Naomi Campbell, Jagged Edge, P. Diddy, Avery Storm, Nelly, Pharrell, Usher, Fat Joe, 8 Ball & MJG, Teairra Mari, Jazze Pha, DJ Green Lantern, Memphis Bleek\n- Topics: guest appearances, supermodels, fashion industry\n\nFacts:\n- Naomi Elaine Campbell was born on 22 May 1970 and is an English model and actress.\n- Naomi Campbell was recruited at age 15.\n- Naomi Campbell became one of the top three most recognisable and in-demand models of the late 1980s and the 1990s.\n- The fashion industry declared Naomi Campbell one of six models of her generation to be supermodels.\n- The song \"Nasty Girl\" features guest appearances from Jagged Edge, P. Diddy, Avery Storm, and Nelly.\n- The video for \"Nasty Girl\" contains guest appearances from Pharrell, Usher, Fat Joe, 8 Ball & MJG, Teairra Mari, Jazze Pha, DJ Green Lantern, Naomi Campbell, and Memphis Bleek.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
